// REVISION PART 1 — EPISODE 4: Equations — Quadratic
// Paste into the EPISODES array in scripts/generate-maths-podcast-audio.mjs,
// next to the existing series: 'Revision-Part-1' episode 1, 2 and 3 objects.
// Slides: unzip into podcasts/Working-It-Out/Revision-Part-1/slides/ep04
